&#xa;&#xa;About the oath keepers and the 3%er...</title><content type='html'>WhiteBuffalo,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;About the oath keepers and the 3%ers.&lt;br /&gt;I would be very suspicious of any member who suggests any illegal act or who offers to help the group gain access to various military arms and munitions.    Both are stock and trade of Fed informants.  There was an old joke about the &amp;quot;way to spot the FBI agent at the Klan/militia/whatever meeting was that he was the one always wanting to blow something up.&amp;quot; (Note, I am not comparing any legit group to the Klan, but it was one of the versions I have heard.)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/6104724542825103280'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/6104724542825103280'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html?showComment=1259944658365#c6104724542825103280' title=''/><author><name>Chris Mallory</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4306631546470845059' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4306631546470845059' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1022363305"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 4, 2009 at 9:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8893583082989534021</id><published>2009-12-04T08:59:21.574-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-04T08:59:21.574-07:00</u