m/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html?showComment=1259891028375#c5673198042790891470' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4306631546470845059' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4306631546470845059' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1940553005"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2009 at 6:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8661499725254175815</id><published>2009-12-03T17:08:11.523-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-03T17:08:11.523-07:00</updated><title type='text'>WNG understands the reality of politics as few oth...</title><content type='html'>WNG understands the reality of politics as few others.&lt;br /&gt;I wonder if he may recall a Los Angeles Times newsman, Jack Nelson, who died last month. Nelson, in an interview, spoke aboutan alphabet agency shooting of KKK fellow and a schoolteacher Kathy Ainsworth back in the late 1960s. Nelson said, in so many words, that an alphabet agency came to MS to do murder, those are Nelson&amp;#39;s words not mine.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have to say I feel sorry for these White guys with the government power players riding them.&lt;br /&gt;WNG did you ever look into the case of Matt Hale?&lt;br /&gt;Anyone reading deeply about the case would have to feel an icy chill up their spine, because after they come for the WNs they come for the rest. If you think Rahm wants to stop at David Duke...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/8661499725254175815'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/8661499725254175815'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html?showComment=1259885291523#c8661499725254175815' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-assembly.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4306631546470845059' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4306631546470845059' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-387271993"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 3, 2009 at 5:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1665025163866114592</id><published>2009-12-03T15:09:50.920-07:00</published><updated>2009-12-03T15:09:50.920-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I must object to your comparison of Mr. Turner wit...</title><content type='html'>I must object to your comparison of Mr. Turner with &amp;quot;any other whore&amp;quot;.  I have nothing but respect for women who offer an honest service for an agreed-upon price, whereas frauds like Hal Turner earn nothing but disgust.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/1665025163866114592'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4306631546470845059/comments/default/1665025163866114592'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/12/prefabricated-fascists-fbis-a